## A correction I owe the record

I reported the opus seat unreachable across six attempts and filed `etude-zc3`
(P0) on that basis. The seat was available throughout: I had been NAMING the
spawned agent, which makes it a persistent teammate that idles instead of
returning a report. Unnamed spawns return normally. The bead is updated with the
root cause rather than closed quietly, because "a seat returning nothing should
prompt a check of the invocation shape before it is called an outage" is the
durable lesson.

